        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lamo i kitipa pa jom'oyeyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo marapena, aoro win ywakirok ri Were, kwayo, poyo joman i kwayo, gi foyo Were ri ji je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwayo ri kerin kodi joman je ma jonitie iy'adhum, ŋey wabedi i kwo m'okwe ma siem, munyo walworo Were aka wabedo gi kite ma ripo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gime ber aka sangala Were Jaboth mawan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma mito ni ji je jowobothi to jolimo ŋeyo adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Were nitie acel, aka nitie ŋat'acel ma riwo Were gi ji, jal m'ilwoŋo ni Kristo Yesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "m'omiyere ma botho ji je. Meno obedo gir'anena, i hongo m'otire, ni Were mito ji je jowobothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tim 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me am'omiyo odiman bedo jamoor kendo jatiti wac ri Jopath, fonjo mikwenda ma mako kwoŋ yeyo kodi adieri. (Akitwodi, to, awaco gir'adieri!)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo ayenyo ni kamoro je ji jowokway, ma jomiyere ri Were aka jotiŋo cingi gin malo i kwayo, m'ongoye nge kosa kiŋunyaŋunya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kendo amito ni mon joworuki nangin mabeyo ma ripo, gi gwokirok; ma jok'ocowo paro pajo i kedo wic ma yodirok, kosa jaŋo kwoŋ gin thiwino ma zahabu kosa atege ma welo kosa ruk ma welo ma malo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jowobedi gi tim mabeyo paka ripo gi mon ma jowaco ni jolworo Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mon joripo winjo fonji munyo jokudere gi mwolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akiyey mon fonjo kosa bedo gi meni kwoŋ cwo, joripo liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 2:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.21+GEN.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 2:21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole otel cweyo Adam, aka nyaka ocwey Eva, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.3.1+GEN.3.2+GEN.3.3+GEN.3.4+GEN.3.5+GEN.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 3:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adam k'amowondi, dhako am'owondi to turo cik pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kad'ameno, dhako bino limo both i nywolo nyithindho, ka go ocwire i yeyo kodi mar gi leŋo, kodi kurok maber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
